{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6f5f518705976e86c427c480c9f1689298d9a900f99e37ce0e7cef12173777cd","ja":"抜かりのないプラン","zh":"滴水不漏的计划","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3e6663a0b7f3774691c1462c4ed3c6744b8bb36de7c1df562c07e17edcd208db","ja":"すっげー！　お昼なのに、\n本当に混んでないじゃん♪","zh":"太厉害了！明明是中午，\n却真的完全不挤嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d229c59f74ae8fee2e57da1c503de8576797204a9ec173307804b99eba2d6e3f","ja":"それに雰囲気もすごくいいし、\nこんな喫茶店って、なかなかないよね！","zh":"而且氛围也特别好，\n这种咖啡厅可不多见呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2cd9fe9bb12698d199bd9ea82945dbd37d00fb4a89ce6aee006f8cc2851fb9a6","ja":"うふふっ♪　穴場の喫茶店を\nリサーチしておいた甲斐がありますわ♪","zh":"呵呵♪ 事先调查好这间\n鲜为人知的咖啡店果然很值得呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"22d546edf472e16aae0e580908c96148b3687ff087b9233ecce8186fd6ab93fb","ja":"もちろん、他にも様々なプランを考えてますわよ。","zh":"当然，我也在考虑其他各种各样的方案哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6180bb206a3bb5ce9b7350c1181d6b0686fbf5536d15f047507727eae32ae24a","ja":"どんなプランがあるんだ？\n例えば、体を動かしたいって時は。","zh":"都有什么样的方案？\n比如想要活动一下身体的时候。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"04a7ab9398a704b2225f1d0f95306614baa7c9b18c4bf32505b80b460d8ab9d1","ja":"それでしたら、運動公園はどうかしら？","zh":"要是那样的话，运动公园怎么样呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a16918e8a5fa2564cff5271576dd0fa9adbb0bdaf1f623d01020efaf758f5bd9","ja":"この季節はお花もたくさん咲いていて、\nとってもいい香りがするそうですわよ。","zh":"这个季节里百花齐放，\n据说香气十分诱人呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"fd34a70b9614ed2a4d411cb6b2684f6dabde6351b7bc775f1c5fe294aaf0acea","ja":"か、香りも楽しめるなんて……♪\nとってもいい公園が、あるんですね。","zh":"连、连香气也能一并享受呢……♪\n这里真是一个很棒的公园呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2094f9d65b5b92a0859a5a13b9c4253b3c1017685eddd4b4b5d4cd82de0e1dbe","ja":"あっ、あのっ！　プランの中に、\nアイドルちゃんに関わるものは、ありますか？","zh":"啊、那个！企划方案里，\n有和偶像们相关的内容吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"b9ec903da4065b4442c9ebf783a5354d967e60e4aedfaa3ef0a54385b659f8c4","ja":"それでしたら、有名アイドルが訪れる\nコロッケの名店が、この近くにありますわよ。","zh":"要是那样的话，附近就有一家\n知名偶像光顾过的炸肉饼名店哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"96a6e5b98b17bec0ff0452479deff34d5e7a192bffbc9f3a20843769df37fba0","ja":"ふおー！　そんなレアな情報まで調べているなんて、\nさすがは千鶴さんですね！","zh":"哇——！连那么冷门的情报都查得一清二楚，\n真不愧是千鹤小姐呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"cc962f51077c1173cabe44de2b9a06c883da361d3bb848b2a5b4c844576dc88c","ja":"他にも、ゆっくり時間を過ごせる美術館や植物園、\nお試しのできる大型家電量販店などもありますわよ。","zh":"此外，还有能悠闲度过时光的美术馆和植物园，\n以及可以体验试用的大型家电量贩店等等哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"78369b851ec984f235d9b354ce0a56d02a31b8507953b6138f622387f7113056","ja":"すごい！\nどんな希望も叶えてくれそうですね♪","zh":"好厉害！\n感觉什么愿望都能实现呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1446.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"ef2c3f05b396f25ab53bb1954489c0518ee64bf4194ce0dbfdd3c240e6c491ab","ja":"ええ、いろいろと取り揃えていますわ。\nやりたいことがあれば、教えてくださいまし！","zh":"是的，准备得相当齐全呢。\n如果有想做的事，请务必告诉我哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
